  m_KeyGenerator:
    rid: 221144884216594722
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds:
    - rid: 221144884216594722
      type: {class: DistributedUIDGenerator, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Tables, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CustomEpoch: 1793828515799
    - rid: 221144884216594727
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'Not text: typewriter speed factor for this language (1 =
          normal; use about 0.5 for Chinese/Japanese/Korean).'
    - rid: 221144884216594728
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Name plate of the plant mascot (the speaker). Keep very short.
    - rid: 221144884216594729
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'Button on the big box: skips the whole conversation. Keep
          short.'
    - rid: 221144884216594730
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'Eri, first meeting. Start screen (pick a farmer and a scythe).
          Big box. Eri slips: ''crashed'' then corrects to ''came''.'
    - rid: 221144884216594731
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Same conversation, line 2. Friendly on the surface, possessive
          underneath.
    - rid: 221144884216594732
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Same conversation, line 3. Farmer and scythe are the two choices
          on this screen.
    - rid: 221144884216594733
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Preparation screen, first run. Big box. The field is still
          empty; the player must buy a planter (pot) in the planter shop, then start
          the round.
    - rid: 221144884216594734
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Planter placement mode, first time. Big box. Clicking an empty
          field cell places it; the R key rotates it.
    - rid: 221144884216594735
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: First round starts. Small box during play. Attacks are automatic
          while the cursor is over plants. Teasing tone (a joke).
    - rid: 221144884216594736
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'Same conversation, line 2. Joke AND the story''s first hidden
          hint: Eri remembers Earth''s technology (it has been to Earth). Keep it
          casual; do not explain or make it obvious.'
    - rid: 221144884216594737
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'First round, after the previous line. Small box. Offering
          (TR: Adak) = the harvest share offered to Eri (the quota panel, top left).
          Game term: translate consistently.'
    - rid: 221144884216594738
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'First level-up: card choice screen. Big box. The chosen card
          lasts for this run.'
    - rid: 221144884216594739
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Last round of an Offering period starts and the Offering is
          not full yet (first time). Small box during play.
    - rid: 221144884216594740
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: An Offering period was met for the first time. Round end screen,
          big box. Satisfied, slightly unsettling.
    - rid: 221144884216594741
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'Same conversation, line 2. Second reading: the hunger keeps
          growing.'
    - rid: 221144884216594742
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: "First Trial (TR: S\u0131nama; boss) round starts. Small box
          during play. Trial = boss round; its own target is shown in the left panel.
          Game term: translate consistently."
    - rid: 221144884216594743
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: First field event (one of Eri's wild seeds) is about to appear.
          Small box during play. Its plate on the left says what it does (some must
          be cut, some give a bonus).
    - rid: 221144884216594744
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Run ended because the Offering was not met (first time). Big
          box. Hungry, cold.
    - rid: 221144884216594745
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Same conversation, line 2.
    - rid: 221144884216594746
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Run ended because a Trial (boss round) was failed (first time).
          Big box.
    - rid: 221144884216594747
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Same conversation, line 2.
    - rid: 221144884216594748
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Run won (first time). Big box. Content, with an unsettling
          second reading.
    - rid: 221144884216594749
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Same conversation, line 2.
    - rid: 221144884216594750
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Speech bubble of Eri on the planet, preparation screen (repeats).
          Very short.
    - rid: 221144884216594751
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Speech bubble of Eri on the planet when an Offering period
          is met (repeats). Very short.
    - rid: 221144893936369745
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'Card choice: caption of the before/after comparison line.
          Keep the arrow and the dot.'
    - rid: 221144893936369746
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'Card choice: caption above the card''s effect on a field
          tile.'
    - rid: 221144893936369747
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'Run end screen button: back to the main menu.'
    - rid: 221144893936369748
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'Planter shop card title: a 1x1 planter (pot).'
    - rid: 221144893936369749
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'Planter shop card title: a 1x2 planter (pot).'
    - rid: 221144893936369750
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'Planter shop card title: a 1x3 planter (pot).'
    - rid: 221144893936369751
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'Planter shop card title: a 2x2 planter (pot).'
    - rid: 221144893936369752
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'Planter shop card title: a 2x3 planter (pot).'
    - rid: 221144893936369753
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'Planter shop button: clears the selection.'
    - rid: 221144893936369754
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Planter shop, detail caption above the seconds a plant needs
          to grow.
    - rid: 221144893936369755
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Planter shop, detail caption above the number of growing plots
          in the planter.
    - rid: 221144893936369756
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'Planter shop button: sell mode.'
    - rid: 221144893936369757
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Planter shop, detail caption above the planter size (e.g.
          2x3).
    - rid: 221144893936369758
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'Preparation screen button: opens the planter (pot) shop.'
    - rid: 221144893936369759
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'Run end screen button: starts a new run. <br> is a line break
          used for layout; keep it.'
    - rid: 221144893936369760
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'Preparation screen button: opens the skill tree shop.'
    - rid: 221144893936369761
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'Card choice screen button: skip the offered cards.'
    - rid: 221144893936369762
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'Preparation screen, main button: starts the next round. Big
          button, keep short.'
    - rid: 221144893936369763
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'Main menu button: opens the settings.'
    - rid: 221144893936369764
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Main menu button. <br> is a line break used for layout; keep
          it.
    - rid: 221144893936369765
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'Main menu button: quits the game.'
    - rid: 221144893936369774
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Settings window title.
    - rid: 221144893936369775
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
