    - rid: 221144899000992091
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: "Boss reward stage name, capitals (EARLY STAGE \xB7 BOSS REWARD)."
    - rid: 221144899000992092
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Boss reward stage name, capitals.
    - rid: 221144899000992093
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Boss reward stage name, capitals.
    - rid: 221144899000992116
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Big badge over a planter shop card that the skill tree has
          not unlocked yet. Short, capitals.
    - rid: 221144903419691008
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Story 1/14, after the first Trial (boss round) is passed.
          Big box. Eri happy and proud; she is secretly the villain, keep a sweet
          tone.
    - rid: 221144903419691009
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'Story 1/14, line 2. She lies: in the very first talk she
          mentioned Earth. Two answer buttons follow.'
    - rid: 221144903419691010
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Story 1/14, player's answer button 1 (trusting). Short. The
          choice is remembered for the ending.
    - rid: 221144903419691011
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Story 1/14, Eri's reply to answer 1.
    - rid: 221144903419691012
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Story 1/14, player's answer button 2 (doubting). Short. The
          choice is remembered for the ending.
    - rid: 221144903419691013
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'Story 1/14, Eri''s reply to answer 2: flustered, covering
          up.'
    - rid: 221144903419691014
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Story 1/14, last line. A warning disguised as worry.
    - rid: 221144903419691015
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Story 2/14, after the first boss reward is taken. Eri happy.
    - rid: 221144903419691016
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Story 2/14, line 2. 'Strong hands' = she needs workers.
    - rid: 221144903419691017
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Story 3/14, preparation screen before round 5. Eri happy.
    - rid: 221144903419691018
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'Story 3/14, line 2. Hint: the player''s work feeds her.'
    - rid: 221144903419691019
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Story 4/14, before round 10. Offering (Adak) = the quota the
          player must harvest for Eri.
    - rid: 221144903419691020
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Story 4/14, line 2.
    - rid: 221144903419691021
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Story 5/14, before round 15. Eri happy, but a dark hint.
    - rid: 221144903419691022
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Story 5/14, line 2. She hesitates and lies (they did not leave).
    - rid: 221144903419691023
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Story 6/14, before round 20. Eri happy; she plants doubt about
          the crash.
    - rid: 221144903419691024
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Story 6/14, line 2. Changes the subject.
    - rid: 221144903419691025
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'Story 7/14, before round 25. From here Eri is grey and sad:
          she will lose the player and her secret is about to come out.'
    - rid: 221144903419691026
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Story 7/14, line 2. 'Wilted' = she has turned grey.
    - rid: 221144903419691027
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Story 7/14, line 3. Two answer buttons follow (not remembered).
    - rid: 221144903419691028
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Story 7/14, player's answer button 1. Short.
    - rid: 221144903419691029
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Story 7/14, Eri's reply to answer 1.
    - rid: 221144903419691030
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Story 7/14, player's answer button 2. Short.
    - rid: 221144903419691031
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'Story 7/14, Eri''s reply to answer 2: sad, knowing.'
    - rid: 221144903419691032
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Story 8/14, before round 30. Eri sad. The blue field is Earth
          (said openly later).
    - rid: 221144903419691033
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Story 8/14, line 2. She ate it.
    - rid: 221144903419691034
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'Story 9/14, before round 35. Eri sad, confessing: she consumed
          the earlier farmers.'
    - rid: 221144903419691035
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Story 9/14, line 2.
    - rid: 221144903419691036
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'Story 10/14, before round 40. Eri sad, confessing: she made
          the player''s ship crash.'
    - rid: 221144903419691037
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Story 10/14, line 2.
    - rid: 221144903419691038
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Story 11/14, before round 45. Eri sad. She all but names Earth.
    - rid: 221144903419691039
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Story 11/14, line 2.
    - rid: 221144903419691040
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Story 12/14, before the last round (the final Trial). Eri
          sad, but calculating.
    - rid: 221144903419691041
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Story 12/14, line 2. Either outcome serves her.
    - rid: 221144903419691042
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'Story 13/14, victory screen of the first full win. Line 1:
          Eri still grey and sad.'
    - rid: 221144903419691043
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'Story 13/14, line 2: the mask falls, Eri turns red (her true
          self). Cold, triumphant.'
    - rid: 221144903419691044
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Story 13/14, line 3. Full confession.
    - rid: 221144903419691045
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Story 13/14, line 4, only if the player trusted her in story
          1 ('Alright, if you say so').
    - rid: 221144903419691046
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Story 13/14, line 4, only if the player doubted her in story
          1 ('Are you sure?').
    - rid: 221144903419691047
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Story 13/14, line 5. Her sadness was an act too.
    - rid: 221144903419691048
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Story 13/14, last line. The cycle goes on.
    - rid: 221144903419691049
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Story 14/14, start of the first run after the first full win.
          Eri red, openly the villain. Offering = the quota.
    - rid: 221144903419691050
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Story 14/14, line 2.
